      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Seen from above, Capstone spreads out like a star, with slides and nets running in several directions from its central tepee tower. That layout lets children climb up from more than one side at once. Pink slides, a striped tube slide, net climbers and a net tunnel give each arm of the star a different job. Capstone takes 40 to 45 children. Its product area is 31'8\" x 31'6\", almost square, and the safe play area is 37'8\" x 37'6\". A square plot in the middle of a society garden or a public park suits it well. Its skills list covers emotional intelligence, leadership and self-directed play. Colours are mixed. We cover the galvanised pipes, roto-moulded slides, composite laminates and play rope for 3 years. Share a site photo and we will check the fit."
